  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "持っていると　テラレイドバトルでもらえる　テラピースが　増える不思議で　きらめいている　おまもり。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "지니고 있으면 테라 레이드배틀에서 받을 수 있는 테라피스가 늘어나는 이상하고 반짝이는 부적.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "只要擁有它，在太晶團體戰中就能獲得更多太晶碎塊的神奇晶亮護符。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un mystérieux charme éclatant qui permet d’obtenir davantage de Téra-Éclats lors des raids Téracristal.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein mysteriöser, glitzernder Glücksbringer, durch den man in Tera-Raids mehr Tera-Stücke erhält.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Misterioso amuleto refulgente que puede aumentar la cantidad de teralitos obtenidos en teraincursiones.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Misterioso amuleto brillante che aumenta le teraliti ottenibili nei Raid Teracristal.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Having one of these mysterious glimmering charms increases the number of Tera Shards you receive from Tera Raid Battles.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持っていると　テラレイドバトルでもらえる　テラピースが　増える不思議で　きらめいている　おまもり。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "拥有它之后，在太晶团体战中会获得更多太晶碎块的神奇闪光护符。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Misterioso amuleto refulgente que puede aumentar la cantidad de teralitos obtenidos en teraincursiones.",
